<H1>Motorcycle Trip Through The Cascades On Washington State Road 20</H1>
Washington State Road 20 offers amazing views of the mountains, lots of twisties. A 50 minute clip I took is on my <A HREF="https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC4GtGsSscnVIDix8HeB0XUw/playlists" target="_blank">Youtube channel</A>:
<BR>
<a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bRYs2F6MxNU&list=PL65CwO7O2fX-MXjt44ijUU7EOX_AhlwTk&index=4" target="_blank">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bRYs2F6MxNU&list=PL65CwO7O2fX-MXjt44ijUU7EOX_AhlwTk&index=4</A>
